# Dev: target for the Vite /api proxy (see vite.config.ts). Keeps auth
# cookies first-party — the browser only ever talks to localhost:5173.
VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=https://api-production-4f160.up.railway.app

# Production: absolute base URL of the API server, ONLY if web and API are
# served from different origins. Leave unset when both share an origin.
# VITE_API_URL=

# Feature flag for the archetype-first UI (Spec 7). Exactly "true" switches it on
# for everyone by default; per browser use ?ff=archetypeCoachUi / ?ff=-archetypeCoachUi.
# VITE_FF_ARCHETYPE_COACH_UI=
